From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ugur-imd <ugur.acikgoz@imd-tec.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 11:12:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] configs: imdt-v2n-sbc: fix arch selection, rename
 TEXT_BASE, set SYS_LOAD_ADDR and OF_UPSTREAM

The defconfig selected the legacy ARCH_RMOBILE architecture, which has
no matching arch/board Kconfig tree in this u-boot version, while all
of imdt-v2n-sbc's other options (R9A09G056, TARGET_IMDT_RZV2N_EVK,
PINCTRL_PFC_RZV2N, etc.) are defined under ARCH_RENESAS, same as
imdt-v2h-sbc. This mismatch causes make oldconfig's dependency solver
to enter a pathological state, running for 15+ minutes before being
OOM-killed.

Selecting ARCH_RENESAS in turn exposes CONFIG_SYS_LOAD_ADDR as a new,
unanswered prompt (no default exists for this SoC family), which
causes oldconfig to loop forever reading EOF from stdin in the
non-interactive bitbake task environment. imdt-v2h-sbc_defconfig sets
this to 0x58000000, which is the start address of its own cma-default
reserved-memory region in the kernel DTS; imdt-v2n-sbc's DTS reserves
its own cma-default region starting at the same address, so the same
value applies by direct analogy.

CONFIG_SYS_TEXT_BASE is also renamed to CONFIG_TEXT_BASE (the option
was renamed upstream; the old name no longer exists in Kconfig and is
silently dropped, leaving CONFIG_TEXT_BASE undefined at compile time),
matching imdt-v2h-sbc_defconfig.

Without an explicit CONFIG_OF_UPSTREAM=n, ARCH_RENESAS boards default
to looking up their device tree under dts/upstream/src/arm64/, where
imdt-v2n-sbc.dts has not been imported, causing a "no rule to make
target" failure at the dtbs build step. imdt-v2h-sbc_defconfig already
sets this to n, keeping the DT build on the existing
arch/arm/dts/imdt-v2n-sbc.dts in this u-boot tree.
---
 configs/imdt-v2n-sbc_defconfig | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/configs/imdt-v2n-sbc_defconfig b/configs/imdt-v2n-sbc_defconfig
index 040b7e9..d5e017c 100644
--- a/configs/imdt-v2n-sbc_defconfig
+++ b/configs/imdt-v2n-sbc_defconfig
@@ -1,8 +1,10 @@
 CONFIG_USB_FUNCTION_MASS_STORAGE=y
 CONFIG_ARM=y
 CONFIG_ARCH_CPU_INIT=y
-CONFIG_ARCH_RMOBILE=y
-CONFIG_SYS_TEXT_BASE=0x50000000
+CONFIG_ARCH_RENESAS=y
+CONFIG_OF_UPSTREAM=n
+CONFIG_TEXT_BASE=0x50000000
+CONFIG_SYS_LOAD_ADDR=0x58000000
 CONFIG_ENV_SIZE=0x20000
 CONFIG_DM_GPIO=y
 CONFIG_DEFAULT_DEVICE_TREE="imdt-v2n-sbc"
--
2.34.1
</content>
